<div id="__nuxt"><div><main id="main-content" class="default-layout__main"><!--[--><div data-page="[uid].vue"><div class="outer-container"><div><!--[--><section id="location-charge-postcodes" class="page-header page-header--standard" index="0" data-v-93adf07f><div class="page-header__container page-header__container--no-media" data-v-93adf07f><div class="page-header__content" data-v-93adf07f><div class="page-header__text-content" data-v-93adf07f><!----><h1 class="page-header__title" data-v-93adf07f>Location Charge Postcodes</h1><!----></div><!----></div><!----></div><!----></section><section id="what-is-a-location-charge?" class="section-wrapper information-table" index="1" data-v-d2116e83 data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><h2 class="information-table__title" data-v-d2116e83>What is a location charge?</h2><p class="information-table__subtitle" data-v-d2116e83>Some locations in the UK are more expensive to deliver to than others, for instance, some may require sending parcels using ferries or are located further from our depots. Because of this, a limited number of postcodes have a small location charge of £2.75 when sending from and delivering to those locations. There’s no location charge when sending within the same postcode area.

A list of affected postcodes can be seen below:</p><div class="information-table__wrap" data-v-d2116e83><table class="information-table__element" data-v-d2116e83><thead class="information-table__table-header" data-v-d2116e83><tr data-v-d2116e83><th class="information-table__column-header" data-v-d2116e83>Location</th><th class="information-table__column-header" data-v-d2116e83>Affected Postcodes</th><!----></tr></thead><tbody data-v-d2116e83><!--[--><tr class="information-table__row" data-v-d2116e83><td class="information-table__cell" data-v-d2116e83><span class="information-table__cell-header" data-v-d2116e83>Location</span><span data-v-d2116e83>Aberdeen</span></td><td class="information-table__cell" data-v-d2116e83><span class="information-table__cell-header" data-v-d2116e83>Affected Postcodes</span><span data-v-d2116e83>AB35-AB38, AB53-AB56</span></td><!----></tr><tr class="information-table__row" data-v-d2116e83><td class="information-table__cell" data-v-d2116e83><span class="information-table__cell-header" data-v-d2116e83>Location</span><span data-v-d2116e83>Falkirk</span></td><td class="information-table__cell" data-v-d2116e83><span class="information-table__cell-header" data-v-d2116e83>Affected Postcodes</span><span data-v-d2116e83>FK17-FK22</span></td><!----></tr><tr class="information-table__row" data-v-d2116e83><td class="information-table__cell" data-v-d2116e83><span class="information-table__cell-header" data-v-d2116e83>Location</span><span data-v-d2116e83>Outer Hebrides</span></td><td class="information-table__cell" data-v-d2116e83><span class="information-table__cell-header" data-v-d2116e83>Affected Postcodes</span><span data-v-d2116e83>All HS postcodes</span></td><!----></tr><tr class="information-table__row" data-v-d2116e83><td class="information-table__cell" data-v-d2116e83><span class="information-table__cell-header" data-v-d2116e83>Location</span><span data-v-d2116e83>Isle of Man</span></td><td class="information-table__cell" data-v-d2116e83><span